customer chat support:
    Simulates a customer support chat system.
    Shows how threading and asyncio can handle multiple chat sessions.
    hreading = multiple threads for users.
    Asyncio = async coroutines for simultaneous chat handling.

health:
    Monitors health metrics (e.g., heart rate, steps, etc.).
    Threading → multiple threads track different metrics.
    Asyncio → async tasks monitor metrics concurrently.

Notification sending:
    Demonstrates notification system.
    Sends notifications to users using both threading and asyncio.
    Threading = parallel notifications with threads.
    Asyncio = async coroutines sending notifications.

package updates:
    Simulates checking for package/software updates.
    Threading = multiple threads checking updates for different packages.
    Asyncio = async version fetching update info concurrently.

pdf:
    Simulates generating or processing PDF files.
    Threading = multiple threads handling different files.
    Asyncio = async tasks for concurrent PDF processing.